# Generated at build time
# NOTE: data/raw/ and data/processed/ are intentionally COMMITTED. The snapshot is the source
# of truth for reproducibility and offline operation (architecture.md §7.3, §18.1). The vector
# store and the model cache are large and rebuildable, so they are not.
data/chroma/
data/models/
data/chunks.jsonl

# Phase 0 spike scratch: 3.3 MB of throwaway HTML/text for candidate URLs, most of them rejected.
# docs/corpus_matrix.md records the findings; Phase 3 re-fetches the 5 accepted sources into
# data/raw/ deterministically, so committing these would only duplicate the corpus.
data/raw/spike/
